                           owners  build credit  valid    CRO  audit
line of defence                 1      1      2      2      2      3
--------------------------------------------------------------------
build or change a model         C      R      I      C      A      I
own a model and its use         A      C      C      C      I      I
validate a model                I      C      I      R      A      I
approve a model for use         C      C      C      C      A      I
monitor a model                 R      R      I      C      A      I
keep the model inventory        I      C      I      C      A      I
override a score or grade       R      I      A      C      I      I
approve commercial credit       R      I      A      I      I      I
set credit policy               C      C      R      I      A      I
audit the whole                 I      I      I      I      I      A

owners  1  retail lending, underwriters, branches, relationship
           managers, collections
build   1  credit risk modelling: build and run models
credit  2  chief credit officer, credit officers, credit committee
valid   2  model validation: independent of the builders
CRO     2  chief risk officer: model risk policy, the inventory,
           reports to the board
audit   3  internal audit: reports to the board's audit committee

one role answers for each task: True
